#: ../../source/optimization_applications.rst:2
msgid "Optimization application patterns"
msgstr "优化应用模式"

#: ../../source/optimization_applications.rst:4
msgid ""
"Quadratic optimization applications often look unrelated at the business "
"level while sharing the same small set of binary modeling patterns.  "
"Keeping those patterns above ``BinaryQuadraticModel`` lets business code "
"change without changing the solver boundary."
msgstr ""
"二次优化应用在业务层面往往看似毫不相关，却共享少数几种二元建模模式。将"
"这些模式保持在 ``BinaryQuadraticModel`` 之上，可以在不改变求解器边界的"
"情况下修改业务代码。"

