#: ../../source/optimization_applications.rst:86
msgid "New example: wireless channel assignment"
msgstr "新增示例：无线信道分配"

#: ../../source/optimization_applications.rst:88
msgid ""
"Let ``x[a, c]`` indicate that access point ``a`` uses channel ``c``.  Every "
"access point must use exactly one channel:"
msgstr ""
"令 ``x[a, c]`` 表示接入点 ``a`` 是否使用信道 ``c``。每个接入点必须恰好"
"使用一个信道："

#: ../../source/optimization_applications.rst:91
msgid "\\sum_c x_{a,c} = 1."
msgstr "\\sum_c x_{a,c} = 1."

#: ../../source/optimization_applications.rst:95
msgid ""
"If access points ``a`` and ``b`` interfere, they cannot use the same channel:"
msgstr "如果接入点 ``a`` 和 ``b`` 相互干扰，则二者不能使用同一信道："

#: ../../source/optimization_applications.rst:97
msgid "x_{a,c}x_{b,c} = 0."
msgstr "x_{a,c}x_{b,c} = 0."

#: ../../source/optimization_applications.rst:101
msgid ""
"The product is nonnegative over binary assignments, so it maps directly to "
"``add_nonnegative_quadratic_zero``.  A linear objective represents channel "
"preferences or operating costs.  This example exercises two-dimensional "
"variable order, multiple named constraints, conflict modeling, and "
"structured business decoding."
msgstr ""
"该乘积在二元赋值下非负，因此可直接映射到 "
"``add_nonnegative_quadratic_zero``。线性目标用于表示信道偏好或运行成本。"
"该示例覆盖二维变量顺序、多个具名约束、冲突建模和结构化业务解码。"

