#: ../../source/optimization_applications.rst:117
msgid "Placement in the architecture"
msgstr "在架构中的位置"

#: ../../source/optimization_applications.rst:119
msgid ""
"These models live in ``examples/`` rather than ``quspect.optimization``.  "
"Asset names, covariance estimates, interference graphs, and result "
"presentation are application policy; the core package should contain only "
"reusable expressions, intermediate representations, lowering, codecs, and "
"solver adapters.  Once several applications converge on stable input and "
"output contracts, a separate applications package can be introduced without "
"changing the hardware-level matrix boundary."
msgstr ""
"这些模型位于 ``examples/``，而不是 ``quspect.optimization``。资产名称、"
"协方差估计、干扰图和结果展示都属于应用策略；核心包应只包含可复用的表达"
"式、中间表示、降级转换、编解码器和求解器适配器。当多个应用形成稳定的"
"输入输出契约后，可以引入独立的应用包，而无需改变硬件层矩阵边界。"
